"• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security." = "• **要求开发者模式：** 在“设置”>“隐私和安全”中将其打开。";
"• **Incomplete app or missing game data:** the APK needs its split files or an OBB. Import the full .apks, .xapk or .apkm.\n" = "• **不完整的应用程序或丢失的游戏数据：** APK 需要其拆分文件或 OBB。导入完整的 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm。";
"• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n" = "• **随TrollStore 一起安装：** TrollStore，其URL 方案设置已打开。";
"• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n" = "• **iOS 26：** StikJIT（内置），带有在计算机上制作的配对文件，以及 LocalDevVPN。";
"• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n" = "• **iOS 27 或更高版本：** 设置 › JIT › 在此 iPhone 上配对。不需要电脑。";
"• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings." = "• **使用多巴胺越狱：** 在越狱设置中为应用程序打开 JIT。";
"• **Needs Google:** the app requires a Google account or Play services Husk cannot provide.\n" = "• **需要Google：** 该应用程序需要Google 帐户或Husk 无法提供的Play 服务。";
"• **Older iOS, or Husk inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n" = "• **旧版iOS，或LiveContainer 内的Husk：** StikDebug 应用程序。";
"• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. " = "• **立即打开和关闭：** 签名证书可能已过期。免费 Apple 帐户有效期为 7 天。";
"• **Protected app:** it checks that it is on a real Android phone, or uses anti-cheat or DRM. Husk does not get around these.\n" = "• **受保护的应用程序：** 它会检查它是否位于真正的Android 手机上，或者使用反作弊或DRM。 Husk 无法绕过这些。";
"• **Uses something Husk does not have yet:** share the report so it can be added." = "• **使用Husk 尚不具备的功能：**共享报告以便添加。";
"• **Wrong kind of CPU code:** the APK only has 32-bit code. Find an arm64 (arm64-v8a) version.\n" = "• **CPU 代码类型错误：** APK 仅具有 32 位代码。找到arm64（arm64-v8a）版本。";
"• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n" = "• **“不受信任的开发人员”：** 转至设置 › 常规 › VPN 和设备管理并信任您的证书。";
